.TH ERSEC 1 "2026-09-06" "ERSEC 29.1.0" "ERSEC Security Platform"
.SH NAME
ersec \- evidence-driven application security platform
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ersec
.BI -t " target"
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
ERSEC performs bounded, authorized, non-destructive web and API security testing and can build security behavior graphs, regression contracts, a security control-plane state, and operate an application-layer runtime Shield.
.SH SAFETY
Only use ERSEC on systems you own or are explicitly authorized to assess. Stateful tests and runtime enforcement require explicit operator configuration.
.SH SEE ALSO
Full documentation is installed with the project and maintained at the ERSEC repository.
